# UK Payroll Calculators — environment variables (names only).
# Copy to Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# (Production). Never commit real values.
#
# The public Supabase project URL and anon key (safe to expose —
# Row Level Security decides what they can reach):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# The service-role key (server-only, bypasses RLS). Set it ONLY as a
# server environment variable in Vercel — never in code, never in a
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable:
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
#
# The admin panel sign-in pair (server-only). The login accepts ONLY
# this email + password, and signs in to the Supabase Auth account
# with the same pair — so ADMIN_PASSWORD must be exactly the password
# of the admin user created in the Supabase dashboard
# (Authentication → Users). Never prefix these with NEXT_PUBLIC_:
ADMIN_EMAIL=
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
